  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ガンダムビルドダイバーズ』よりヒロインのサラがきゃらっがいになって登場！",
      "en": "From \"Gundam Build Divers\", the heroine Sarah appears as a character!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• フェイスパーツは優しい表情と笑顔の選択式。",
      "en": "• Face parts include a selection of gentle expressions and smiles."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部パーツは差し替え式でプチッガイも再現可能！",
      "en": "• The head parts are replaceable, allowing you to recreate Petitgguy!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 後ろ髪は別パーツでかわいらしく可動！",
      "en": "• The back hair is a separate part and is cutely movable!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 他のきゃらっがいと連結可能な台座付き！",
      "en": "• Comes with a pedestal that can be connected to other Charagguys!"
    }
  ],
